title=Easy+Weathering+Techniques+for+Miniatures&slug=easy-weathering-techniques&content=%3Ch1%3EEasy+Weathering+Techniques+for+Miniatures%3C%2Fh1%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShort+answer%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Three+techniques+cover+90%25+of+beginner+weathering%3A+sponge+chipping+for+worn+edges%2C+streaking+grime+for+vertical+runs%2C+and+pigment+powders+for+dust+and+mud.+All+three+need+no+special+skills+%E2%80%94+just+dark+paints%2C+a+torn+foam+pad+and+patience.+Start+with+one+technique+per+model%2C+not+three+at+once.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EDisclosure%3A+Some+links+on+this+page+are+affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+if+you+buy+through+them%2C+we+may+earn+a+small+commission+at+no+extra+cost+to+you.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EWhy+Weathering+Wins+Games+of+a+Different+Kind%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EA+clean+model+looks+like+a+product+photo.+A+weathered+model+looks+like+it+%3Cem%3Elives%3C%2Fem%3E+in+its+world.+Weathering+is+the+cheapest+way+to+make+a+tabletop+army+look+experienced+%E2%80%94+and+it+hides+beginner+mistakes%3A+uneven+highlights+and+sloppy+edges+disappear+under+grime.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EEssential+Tools%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3EDark+brown%2C+dark+grey+and+black+paints%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EA+piece+of+torn+packaging+foam+%28the+%22sponge%22%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EWash+or+streaking+grime+product%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EPigment+powders+%28brown%2C+ochre%2C+grey%29+%E2%80%94+optional+but+transformative%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3ECotton+buds+for+corrections%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStep+1%3A+Sponge+Chipping+%28Edges+and+Worn+Zones%29%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3ELoad+a+small+piece+of+torn+foam+with+dark+paint+%E2%80%94+less+than+you+think%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EDab+off+most+of+it+on+paper+tissue%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EPress+lightly+along+edges+that+would+take+abuse%3A+armour+corners%2C+hatch+rims%2C+weapon+grips%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3ERepeat+with+a+lighter+rust+tone+at+50%25+of+the+spots%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ERule%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+chips+follow+logic.+Feet%2C+front+edges%2C+handles+and+hatches+wear%3B+backs+and+tops+stay+cleaner.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStep+2%3A+Streaking+Grime+%28Vertical+Runs%29%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3ERain+and+gravity+pull+dirt+downward.+Take+a+very+thin+dark+wash%2C+touch+it+to+the+upper+part+of+a+vertical+surface%2C+and+drag+a+single+thin+line+downward.+Let+it+dry+fully.+Two+or+three+subtle+streaks+per+vehicle+panel+are+enough+%E2%80%94+more+looks+dirty+in+the+wrong+way.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStep+3%3A+Dust+and+Mud+Pigments%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3EPick+a+pigment+powder+%28earth+brown+for+tracks+and+legs%2C+grey+for+dry+environments%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EApply+with+a+soft+brush+to+lower+surfaces%3A+boots%2C+wheels%2C+track+guards%2C+hems+of+robes%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EFix+it+with+a+pigment+fixer+%E2%80%94+or+skip+the+fixer+on+models+you+don%27t+handle+often%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Cp%3EConcentrate+pigments+where+the+model+touches+the+world%3A+the+lowest+20%25+of+the+miniature.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3ERecommended+Hobby+Supplies%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EItem%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EWhy+it+matters%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3ELevel%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EWeathering+pigment+set+%28earth+tones%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EDust%2C+mud+and+soot+in+one+box%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBeginner-friendly%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EStreaking+grime+enamel%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EThe+pro+shortcut+for+panel+runs%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EIntermediate%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EMakeup+sponge+pack%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ECheaper+than+hobby+sponges%2C+same+result%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EAll%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EPigment+fixer%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EKeeps+dust+where+you+put+it%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EAll%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3E%28Affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+support+more+guides+by+buying+through+them.%29%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EFAQ%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIs+weathering+bad+for+beginners%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+opposite+%E2%80%94+it%27s+beginner-forgiving.+Weathering+hides+mistakes+and+has+no+%22perfect+line%22+to+fail+at.+It%27s+the+most+encouraging+technique+to+learn+early.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow+much+weathering+is+too+much%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EWhen+you+can+no+longer+tell+what+the+model%27s+base+colour+is.+Aim+for+20%25+weathered+surface%2C+80%25+original+finish+%E2%80%94+even+on+%22very+grimdark%22+armies.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ECan+I+weather+with+just+a+wash%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EYes%3A+a+targeted+dark+wash+on+edges+and+recesses+plus+pigments+on+the+feet+is+a+legitimate+5-minute+weathering+pass.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDo+pigments+rub+off+during+games%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EUnfixed+pigments+do.+Use+pigment+fixer%2C+or+seal+the+model+with+matte+varnish+after+weathering.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EContinue+on+the+Workbench%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Frust-and-battle-damage%2F%22%3EHow+to+Paint+Rust%2C+Chipping+and+Battle+Damage%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+deeper+version+of+Step+1%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Fglowing-plasma-effects%2F%22%3EHow+to+Paint+Glowing+Plasma+Effects%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+contrast%3A+clean+glow+on+grim+armour%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Fkitbashing-guide%2F%22%3EKitbashing+Guide%3A+Unique+Sci-Fi+Miniatures%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Flore%2Fchaotic-factions%2F%22%3EThe+Corrupt+Cults%3A+Faction+Lore%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+rusted+aesthetic%2C+explained%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWeather+one+model+completely+before+touching+the+squad.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Your+first+weathered+miniature+teaches+more+than+ten+tutorials.+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fshop%2Fweathering%2F%22%3EGet+a+pigment+starter+set+%E2%86%92%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%3Cem%3E%28affiliate+links%29%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E&status=publish